THOUGHT: I’ll implement the foundational REST API plus C.1 reactions/DMs in a single shared SQLite database, with durable per-channel events and polling-based WebSocket fan-out so all HTTP nodes observe the same sequence. I’ll also add the required launcher and dependency files.

